WEBVTT

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.830
A mysterious organization
lurks in the shadows and

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:11.740
seeks the powers of Karasumori
and they continue to send in Ayakashi.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:16.100
But their true objective...

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.670
I will ask the worm directly.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.480
I'm taking back the human skin.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.660
Your sacrifice for the sake of
research is appreciated.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.950
And now...

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:13.830
The power is strong here.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:15.700
I take it you understand that?

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.470
So this is Karasumori.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:29.080
There is only one rule
you must adhere to.

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.250
Restrain yourself.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:38.830
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:40.700
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:45.900
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:47.800
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.240
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:55.640
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:59.180
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.520
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:08.180
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:12.690
Sha la la la la...

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:19.100
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.070
(Secret romance)

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:26.270
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.040
(A strange distance)

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:34.880
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:35.950
Yeah

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:39.420
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:43.020
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:48.360
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.040
Ayakashi that look human?

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:10.980
That's a very tasteless thing to hear
on this bright sunny morning.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:13.850
Tasteless?

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.680
This is serious. Sensei!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.090
Never mind that.
Would you like some tea?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.860
The Earl Grey is getting cold.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.660
Hey you.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.730
Stop using the student
counseling room

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.360
as your personal space!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:34.130
My personal space?
Don't be silly.

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:38.540
I'm using my own money
to decorate this place

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.850
so that troubled students can
feel a bit more comfortable here.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.120
Stop wasting your money
on stupid stuff like that.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.180
Well, you know...

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.290
I'm not sure if we should
even have this room.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:56.800
Because there's not
one student in this school

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.890
that needs counseling!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:03.870
Oh. what a wonderful school we have!

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.600
What is up with this carefree teacher?

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:10.880
Hey, Tokine.
Should we even bother?

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.910
Well. we should at least tell him.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.410
So, the Ayakashi that
disguise themselves as human...

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.010
Stop going back to
the subject suddenly.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.480
You also are Specially-Talented,
so I thought we should warn you.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.750
If you notice anything strange,
please let us know.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.660
Ayakashi only appear at night.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.900
So why are you warning me,

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:35.300
since I'm only at school
during the day?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.130
He's not stupid after all when
he puts his mind to it!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.900
You're one to talk.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:45.470
Those Ayakashi disguise
themselves as humans very well.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.070
In other words.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:51.180
they may try to infiltrate
this school during the day?

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:54.120
Yes. It's a possibility, but...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.180
Maybe they're already
in the school

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.060
and switched with someone.

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:04.300
I don't know about that.
but it's not impossible.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:09.260
So I must doubt my colleagues
and students now.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.500
God can be such a prankster.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.040
Oh, speaking of which!

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.440
Did something happen?

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.170
Well, recently...

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.480
I became the advisor for
the gardening club,

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.780
so you should come see
our great rose garden!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.380
You don't need to tell us
stuff like that...

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.560
Oh yes. And one more thing.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.690
This better be good.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:39.090
My adorable guardians
can now talk.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.760
I'm Roxanne.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:41.930
I'm Simone.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.630
I'm Josephine.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.540
- Hi there...
- Everybody!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.070
Long time no see!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:52.470
Isn't this because of Karasumori?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.240
Maybe. They're learning
new tricks a lot quicker too.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:58.650
Hey, stop taking them out
at school!

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:02.050
Please stop it, Sensei! Promise me!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.360
But they're so adorable!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.890
I can't follow your reasoning!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.520
You don't have to be so mad.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.930
I'll look out for Ayakashi
disguised as humans.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.670
What did you do with
that skin from the arm?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.480
I gave it to Grandpa Shige.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.180
He said that he would
check it out.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:31.940
It seemed like he had
some connections.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.910
Grandma said that she'd check
things out on her end too.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.150
Okay.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.250
Are you sleepy?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:40.850
I'm fine.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.730
Now that I think about it...

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.860
He doesn't cry anymore.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:55.840
Back then he couldn't do
anything unless I helped him.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.480
Are you listening?!

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:01.740
I'm sorry...

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:05.450
Damn it! There could be an Ayakashi
wearing human skin

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:09.080
walking around right now.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:13.590
You're not Mino. but call me
if anything happens.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:17.130
It'll depend on what happens,
if I can manage it alone.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:18.630
Just call me!

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.170
You know...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.640
You have to stop putting
yourself in harm's way.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.040
You said that.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.440
So. don't do stuff like that too.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.810
I don't ever want to see
anyone get hurt again.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.420
Really all he did was
follow me around.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.160
I guess he's grown up a little.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.290
He's gotten taller too.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.840
He doesn't want to see
anyone get hurt...

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.130
I guess he'll always be kind
and naïve deep down.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.900
But those are also
his good points...

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.340
What are you laughing at?
Are you listening?

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.250
Uh yeah. I'm totally listening.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:14.050
I guess I don't want those parts
of him to change.

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.830
Sumimura looks deep asleep,
as always.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:26.690
Hey, Ichigaya!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:27.990
Do you have some hair wax?

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.100
I want to make some
demon horns.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.300
Don't do it.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.900
Tabata-kun, you can use this.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.030
Oh! Thank you!

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.510
Ain't this great?

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:44.150
Uh-oh, they're playing
with Sumimura-kun.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:47.550
They're toying with him.
He's in trouble!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.610
Let's go, Yuri.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.560
Where are we going?

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:54.490
The class next door. of course.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.960
They have a transfer student.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.660
A transfer student?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.170
Yeah! It's rare during
this time of year!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.400
It's a boy, right?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.330
What if he's handsome?

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.100
That would be great!

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.130
Um...

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.800
Why do you want to go see him?

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.940
You're no fun at all!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:15.010
Don't you understand
the word "curiosity"?

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.510
I've got lots of it!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:18.540
Oh, I get it.

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:21.680
The only one you're interested
in is Sumimura-kun.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:26.420
N-No! I'll go! Please let me go.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.630
I wonder what he's like.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.660
I don't think you should
get your hopes up.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:35.530
Why not? I do have my hopes up!
I love the wild ones!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.000
So you like the dirty-looking ones?

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:39.230
That's not it!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.010
Hey, which one's the transfer student?

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.390
Huh? He was just here
a second ago.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:10:00.550
What was that just now?
It came from him.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.390
It was the smell... of blood...

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.570
Yuri! Yuri!

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.060
Y-Yes?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.960
They said the transfer student
isn't here.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.770
Th-That's too bad.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.940
Then maybe it was him...

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.820
Huh? Where did he go?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.830
You okay?

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:40.860
I-I'm fine.

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:47.830
Was it just my imagination?

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:51.440
But that smell was...

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.510
Isn't this awesome?

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.910
You should do it like this
to make it cuter.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.540
Hey, does anyone have
a rubber band?

00:10:58.720 --> 00:10:59.880
Yeah, right here.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.220
I think you should stop right there.

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:04.580
Uh-oh.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.650
Hurry! The teacher's coming.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.660
Hey, that's really good!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:18.470
What should I do?
It's really bothering me.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:19.500
That smell...

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.740
I know. I should ask
Sumimura-kun about it.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.220
No! He might find me annoying
if I go to him too often.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.780
Now for this question.
Kanda, try to answer it.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.950
It's okay.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:35.420
It was definitely just
my imagination!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.120
Hey, Kanda!
Are you listening?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.720
Y-Yes! It's just my imagination!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.220
I-I see.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:46.530
That's it for today.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.360
U-Um...

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.470
Sumimura-kun.
do you have a minute?

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.200
Anyways, please come with me!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.240
She's taking Sumimura
somewhere again.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:00.110
She's actually pretty bold
about these things.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.580
S-Sumimura-kun.
what should I do?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.180
There's another weird person...

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:10.390
Sorry, but can we do this
another time?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.990
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.280
Bye.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.330
Wait. Maybe you should
take this off.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.930
Sorry, but can we do
this another time?

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:25.360
Bye.

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:27.370
Um...

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:30.470
Sorry, but can we do
this another time?

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.680
Sumimura-kun must be really tired.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:48.720
Sorry, but can we do this
another time?

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:50.290
What?

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:51.790
Bye.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.730
Stop messing around.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:59.430
Sorry, but can we do this
another time?

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.640
Stop messing around.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:25.030
My Shikigami disappeared...
No it was destroyed?!

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:29.290
I made it a lot more elaborate
and durable than usual.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:31.560
It wasn't an accident!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.540
Negative Energy!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.020
How can it be? In broad daylight?

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:54.950
Could it be?!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.660
Yoshimori!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.300
What was that Negative Energy?

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:13.110
W-What is this?! Who did this?!

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:18.380
I don't know.
but it definitely wasn't human!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.680
My Shikigami was destroyed here!

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:22.590
Your Shikigami?!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.020
Someone destroyed it.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:39.900
Hey, middle-schooler. Shouldn't you be
in class right now?

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.930
You really shouldn't ditch class...

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.040
or do you want something from us?

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.800
Not really. Just want to pass through.

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:53.050
I put a lot of effort into making
my Shikigami today.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.850
There's no way that anyone
could have seen through it.

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:57.850
And yet someone did.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.680
Wait, why are you even using
a Shikigami?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:02.860
Aren't you supposed to be
in class?

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.300
L-Look at this!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.930
Only Ayakashi can do
this much damage!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.930
But if it was an Ayakashi,

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.800
we would've known the moment
it entered the school.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:16.300
Maybe an Ayakashi wearing human skin
made it inside.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:20.170
Even so. it shouldn't be able
to use its powers in broad daylight.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.080
If it can, it must be very powerful.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.010
But isn't it weird?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.050
I felt the Negative Energy after
the Shikigami was destroyed.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.390
Huh? Not when your Shikigami
was destroyed?

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:37.660
Yeah. And it purposely used
its powers to leave this evidence.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:40.230
What is it trying to do?

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.930
I think we're being taunted.

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:49.570
Tokine, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.340
Wait! Where are you going?!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.810
I'm going to find the guys
who are messing around!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.410
There he goes again.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.650
Wait. what excuse should
I give for skipping class?

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.820
I better find out where it is.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.360
Go! Tell me the moment
you find anything strange!

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:15.930
You sure have bloomed quite beautifully.

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.200
Just like me.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.570
Your fragrance is superb.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:26.510
Here's your water!
Drink up!

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:39.880
The Shikigami haven't found it yet.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.500
Hey! Are you all right?!
Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:50.030
What happened here?

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.640
There was some middle-schooler
we never saw before.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:56.470
S-Short kid with spiked hair.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.900
Someone they never saw before?

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.870
Could it be the transfer student?!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.980
Why are you doing this?

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:06.850
Who are you?

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:08.880
Don't you know?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.320
You have to introduce yourself when
you meet people for the first time.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:13.350
You're no ordinary human.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.520
W-What are you talking about?!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.260
You smell.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.900
Oh, that's the fragrance of
my beloved roses...

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.830
Mino is in danger!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:30.210
A-All right.
Then I'll introduce myself first.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:32.740
I'm an English teacher at
the high school campus,

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:33.800
and my name is Mino Tatsumi,

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.280
also known as the Prince of White Roses.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.880
Now then, what's your name?

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:46.520
Mino!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:47.620
Mino!

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:52.860
Mino! Are you all right?

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.890
Y-Yeah. I'm alive.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:59.670
Was it a short kid from
the junior high with spiked hair?

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.770
Yes. And his eyes were like this.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:08.340
But I didn't bring out Roxanne or
the others. Since we promised, right?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:11.920
You know, if your life is in danger,
you can use them.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:12.940
Oh, and one more thing.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.850
He seems to hate English.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.720
I asked him for his name
in English

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:19.350
and he got mad at me.

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:21.250
Of course he'll get mad...

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.300
So do you think... that was it?

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.230
An Ayakashi wearing human skin.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:33.830
He knew I was Specially-Talented,
and he was really strong too.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:35.770
My Shiki!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.840
Shiki! Take care of Mino!

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.980
Yoshimori-kun!
Where are you going?

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.680
How did he destroy it?

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:46.950
Did he use some
kind of projectile?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.120
My Shiki was flying!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.740
You're late.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:22.710
No mistake!
Short kid, in junior high with spiked hair!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.450
Who are you?!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.450
You're late.

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:32.920
Why you-!

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:44.180
That jerk! So he's using himself
as the projectile!

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.170
Bring it on! Ketsu!

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:51.640
Oh?

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:57.410
Hey, you! Stay right there!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:04.500
Hey! I told you to stay there!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.020
Yoshimori!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:09.630
Geez! Where did he go?

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:11.040
Wait!

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:12.660
Yoshimori!

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:17.340
Who's that? Is that the Ayakashi?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:24.770
Wait!

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.480
I said wait!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.620
So he can follow me at this speed?

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:34.380
In that case...

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:37.290
What?!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.290
Why you-!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:56.810
Too slow!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.990
So you're no good
at close combat.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:09.160
This wasn't that fast either.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.790
Aren't you relying on
your techniques too much?

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:14.690
Ketsu!

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.270
And even this technique isn't much.

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:23.800
What is he trying to do?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.440
What?!

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:35.540
Negative Energy!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.010
Yoshimori!

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:48.060
Those claw marks...

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:51.200
You're joking right?

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.440
The Legitimate Heir's Kekkai
can't be this weak.

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:58.810
Your movements and reactions are slow.

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:01.010
A complete disappointment.

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:04.310
And I have to assist you?

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:07.110
Who... are you?

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:11.680
Shishio Gen from the Night Troops,
Task Force of the Shadow Organization.

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:14.480
Dispatched to provide security

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:16.860
for the Karasumori Site
and assist the Kekkaishi here.

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:18.250
What?!

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:22.100
Are you really his brother?

00:22:24.670 --> 00:22:27.440
The Night Troops...
it's my brother's...

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:52.560
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:56.970
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:01.270
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.700
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:18.190
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:26.930
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:31.760
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:40.370
Don't cry

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:49.120
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:53.950
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.990 --> 00:24:02.370
Don't cry
